# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# PRIVATE registry data — never commit (repo is public).
/data/*
# Exception: not registry data — Lenin's own public CV/portfolio content (AI
# context pack), same category as public/masters/. Must ship to prod.
!/data/profile/
docs/*tracking-registry*.md
# Personal backlog — has company names; repo is public.
/TODO.md
# Model selection guide — personal reference.
docs/model-selection.md
# Misc personal assets — not part of the app.
/assets/interesting-stuffs/
# Claude.ai skill build artifacts: copies of the source pack + the zip.
# Only SKILL.md is tracked — see docs/claude-ai/README.md.
/docs/claude-ai/skill/cv-materials/background.md
/docs/claude-ai/skill/cv-materials/spec-cache.json
/docs/claude-ai/skill/*.zip

